571
00:24:12,079 --> 00:24:14,400
you'll understand when you're older.

572
00:24:15,720 --> 00:24:17,960
They aren't as important as you think.

573
00:24:21,359 --> 00:24:22,440
Or perhaps,

574
00:24:24,119 --> 00:24:25,799
you never really cared.

575
00:24:31,559 --> 00:24:33,319
A man who, on his night shifts,

576
00:24:33,799 --> 00:24:36,119
only hides away to masturbate...

577
00:24:37,039 --> 00:24:40,720
do you think he knows the value of freedom?

578
00:24:41,039 --> 00:24:43,680
Do you think he cherishes his time?

579
00:24:43,960 --> 00:24:46,200
Do you think he values the people around him?

580
00:24:50,880 --> 00:24:52,039
In reality,

581
00:24:54,160 --> 00:24:56,039
only loss and suffering

582
00:24:59,079 --> 00:25:01,039
can make a person see clearly,

583
00:25:02,559 --> 00:25:03,680
and make them strong.

584
00:25:06,079 --> 00:25:08,000
How I view good and evil, truth and lies,

585
00:25:08,079 --> 00:25:09,519
is not for you to judge.

586
00:25:37,240 --> 00:25:38,079
Take your time.

587
00:25:39,440 --> 00:25:41,720
Isn't that how everyone grows up?

588
00:25:53,319 --> 00:25:55,279
Following deliberation by the collegial panel,

589
00:25:55,359 --> 00:25:56,799
in the case of the defendant, Zhang Lin,

590
00:25:56,920 --> 00:25:59,200
suspected of the crime of rape,

591
00:25:59,279 --> 00:26:01,559
the facts are clear and the evidence is sufficient.

592
00:26:01,640 --> 00:26:04,440
This court hereby renders the following verdict:

593
00:26:04,599 --> 00:26:05,519
All rise!

594
00:26:11,880 --> 00:26:14,680
The defendant, Zhang Lin, is guilty of rape

595
00:26:14,960 --> 00:26:18,000
and is sentenced to five years in prison.

596
00:26:18,599 --> 00:26:20,200
If you disagree with this verdict,

597
00:26:20,200 --> 00:26:23,119
starting from the day after receiving the written judgment,

598
00:26:23,240 --> 00:26:24,039
you may, within ten days,

599
00:26:24,119 --> 00:26:25,039
through this court

600
00:26:25,039 --> 00:26:28,680
or to the Jiangliu Intermediate People's Court,

601
00:26:28,759 --> 00:26:30,079
file an appeal.

602
00:26:30,240 --> 00:26:31,279
For a written appeal,

603
00:26:31,359 --> 00:26:34,240
you must submit one original copy of the appeal petition

604
00:26:34,240 --> 00:26:35,599
and two duplicate copies.

605
00:26:35,759 --> 00:26:36,960
The reading of the verdict is concluded.

606
00:26:37,359 --> 00:26:38,319
Please be seated.

607
00:26:39,839 --> 00:26:41,759
Bailiffs, please escort the defendant out.

608
00:27:04,880 --> 00:27:05,680
Court is adjourned.

609
00:27:06,599 --> 00:27:07,559
Good work.

610
00:28:11,759 --> 00:28:12,640
Dad.

611
00:30:15,400 --> 00:30:16,200
Hey, Lao Wang.

612
00:30:17,640 --> 00:30:18,720
I'm just calling to remind you.

613
00:30:18,960 --> 00:30:20,319
Remember to come in for your checkup tomorrow.

614
00:30:23,440 --> 00:30:24,240
I wanted to ask you,

615
00:30:24,240 --> 00:30:26,160
should I report this to my superiors first?

616
00:30:27,039 --> 00:30:27,519
Not yet.

617
00:30:28,000 --> 00:30:29,000
We don't have a final diagnosis yet.

618
00:30:29,480 --> 00:30:30,599
If you report it now,

619
00:30:30,799 --> 00:30:31,839
and the diagnosis turns out negative,

620
00:30:31,839 --> 00:30:32,559
how would you explain that?

621
00:30:33,559 --> 00:30:35,480
So don't say anything for the next few days.

622
00:30:36,240 --> 00:30:36,799
That's true.

623
00:30:38,200 --> 00:30:39,759
I'll arrange the checkup for you first.

624
00:30:40,079 --> 00:30:41,079
If the results turn out bad,

625
00:30:41,079 --> 00:30:42,000
as for how to report to the higher-ups,

626
00:30:42,160 --> 00:30:43,000
you'll at least be prepared.

627
00:30:43,240 --> 00:30:44,400
Lao Wang, I wanted to ask you.

628
00:30:45,000 --> 00:30:47,119
Did you mail me a math test paper?

629
00:30:47,119 --> 00:30:48,240
No, I didn't.

630
00:30:48,960 --> 00:30:50,839
But doing math problems in your free time

631
00:30:50,960 --> 00:30:52,039
could actually be helpful.

632
00:30:52,519 --> 00:30:53,960
Okay.

633
00:31:13,359 --> 00:31:14,799
I'll have a pork floss bun.

634
00:31:14,799 --> 00:31:15,599
We don't have any.

635
00:31:15,880 --> 00:31:17,680
I remember buying one. Right here.

636
00:31:18,079 --> 00:31:19,519
That's the second time you've asked.

637
00:31:19,759 --> 00:31:21,640
And you're buying this soda for the second time, too.

638
00:31:22,359 --> 00:31:23,720
Check your payment history.

639
00:31:38,720 --> 00:31:39,279
Xiao Sun

640
00:31:39,279 --> 00:31:40,839
Mr. Yu, you haven't eaten yet, right?

641
00:31:41,880 --> 00:31:42,640
Here, try this.

642
00:31:42,880 --> 00:31:43,559
It's fennel and pork.

643
00:31:43,559 --> 00:31:44,880
Eat it while it's hot. It's really good.

644
00:31:45,039 --> 00:31:46,599
Thank you. You shouldn't have.

645
00:31:47,359 --> 00:31:48,079
So, how are things?

646
00:31:48,799 --> 00:31:49,759
How have you been lately?

647
00:31:51,880 --> 00:31:52,640
Mr. Yu,

648
00:31:52,799 --> 00:31:54,240
I recently heard people say

649
00:31:54,240 --> 00:31:54,960
that you might be

650
00:31:54,960 --> 00:31:56,240
looking for a judge's assistant.

651
00:31:56,680 --> 00:31:58,759
My major was actually criminal litigation,

652
00:31:58,759 --> 00:31:59,599
but they just had to

653
00:31:59,599 --> 00:32:01,079
assign me to the civil division.

654
00:32:01,200 --> 00:32:02,160
Otherwise, you know we could...

655
00:32:02,160 --> 00:32:04,000
Mr. Yu, I got some food from the...

656
00:32:06,000 --> 00:32:08,000
Judge Sun, are you just visiting?

657
00:32:08,799 --> 00:32:09,279
No.

658
00:32:09,279 --> 00:32:10,680
I was just discussing with Mr. Yu...

659
00:32:10,680 --> 00:32:12,599
a case involving both criminal and civil law.

660
00:32:12,599 --> 00:32:13,519
Just asking for some advice.

661
00:32:13,519 --> 00:32:14,160
You guys talk.

662
00:32:14,160 --> 00:32:15,720
No, no, no. I'll leave you to it.

663
00:32:15,799 --> 00:32:16,400
Mr. Yu,

664
00:32:16,400 --> 00:32:18,000
you don't need to wash the lunchbox.

665
00:32:18,000 --> 00:32:18,839
I'll come pick it up later.

666
00:32:18,839 --> 00:32:19,319
Alright.

667
00:32:19,319 --> 00:32:19,839
Make sure to try it.

668
00:32:19,839 --> 00:32:20,519
Will do.

669
00:32:20,519 --> 00:32:21,319
I'm leaving, Xiao Xin.

670
00:32:21,480 --> 00:32:22,319
Goodbye.

671
00:32:24,480 --> 00:32:26,400
You shouldn't be such a pushover.

672
00:32:26,400 --> 00:32:28,319
Our division keeps taking on thankless tasks

673
00:32:28,319 --> 00:32:29,440
and dumping them on you.

674
00:32:29,559 --> 00:32:30,599
If you ruin your health,

675
00:32:30,599 --> 00:32:32,319
it really won't be worth it.

676
00:32:32,720 --> 00:32:33,839
Why are the civil division's...

677
00:32:33,839 --> 00:32:35,720
Xiao Xin, let me tell you something.

678
00:32:36,000 --> 00:32:39,119
Cases shouldn't be judged as thankless or not.

679
00:32:39,119 --> 00:32:41,039
Don't say things like that anymore.

680
00:32:41,039 --> 00:32:42,440
You may have few worldly desires

681
00:32:42,440 --> 00:32:43,200
and no political ambitions.

682
00:32:44,319 --> 00:32:46,519
We are all here to serve the people.

683
00:32:47,720 --> 00:32:49,039
Oh right, Mr. Yu,

684
00:32:49,039 --> 00:32:50,000
here's a package for you.

685
00:32:50,000 --> 00:32:51,359
I picked it up for you on my way.

686
00:32:51,359 --> 00:32:52,160
Alright. Thanks.

687
00:32:52,279 --> 00:32:53,079
Lao Yu.

688
00:32:53,920 --> 00:32:55,400
Lao Yu, come with me for a sec.

689
00:32:55,400 --> 00:32:56,559
Come here. Come on, hurry up.

690
00:32:56,599 --> 00:32:57,319
Coming, coming.

691
00:32:57,319 --> 00:32:58,119
Hurry, hurry, hurry.

692
00:32:58,480 --> 00:33:00,480
I've only been in office for two months!

693
00:33:00,480 --> 00:33:02,440
If the Political and Legal Affairs leaders come to inspect,

694
00:33:02,440 --> 00:33:03,240
and I mess up again,

695
00:33:03,240 --> 00:33:03,920
how am I supposed to handle it?

696
00:33:03,920 --> 00:33:04,680
I can't deal with this!

697
00:33:04,960 --> 00:33:06,279
Give me justice!

698
00:33:06,279 --> 00:33:08,559
Sir, please stop shouting.

699
00:33:08,599 --> 00:33:09,480
You're not in charge!

700
00:33:09,480 --> 00:33:10,039
What's the point of talking to you?

701
00:33:10,039 --> 00:33:11,440
Sir, please listen to me.

702
00:33:11,440 --> 00:33:12,960
Everyone wants to win their case.

703
00:33:12,960 --> 00:33:13,880
I completely understand how you feel.

704
00:33:13,880 --> 00:33:16,160
Even court protests are professionalized now.

705
00:33:16,519 --> 00:33:19,599
They have dedicated people leading them,

706
00:33:19,599 --> 00:33:20,480
professional protest leaders,

707
00:33:20,480 --> 00:33:22,160
teaching them how to protest at the court entrance.

708
00:33:22,400 --> 00:33:23,799
Police are hitting people!

709
00:33:24,160 --> 00:33:25,640
Police are hitting people!

710
00:33:25,880 --> 00:33:26,960
Police are hitting people!

711
00:33:26,960 --> 00:33:28,960
But it's always the same few groups of people.

712
00:33:28,960 --> 00:33:30,039
Go and...

713
00:33:30,039 --> 00:33:31,119
try to calm them down first.

714
00:33:31,119 --> 00:33:31,720
Okay, please do.

715
00:33:31,720 --> 00:33:33,079
Find out what channels they're from.

716
00:33:33,079 --> 00:33:34,200
Okay, I'm counting on you. Please.

717
00:33:37,599 --> 00:33:39,599
Everyone, everyone, listen to me! Listen to me!

718
00:33:39,599 --> 00:33:40,960
Give me justice!

719
00:33:46,880 --> 00:33:48,319
Hey, hey, Lao Kong.

720
00:33:48,319 --> 00:33:49,359
Judge Yu.

721
00:33:49,519 --> 00:33:51,480
Your business has been booming lately.

722
00:33:52,079 --> 00:33:52,880
What are you doing?

723
00:33:52,880 --> 00:33:54,519
Taking money to help them protest?

724
00:33:54,920 --> 00:33:56,079
This is a courthouse.

725
00:33:56,599 --> 00:33:58,599
There are cameras and facial recognition.

726
00:33:58,599 --> 00:33:59,839
Everything is recorded.

727
00:33:59,839 --> 00:34:02,079
You keep using the same group of people.

728
00:34:02,400 --> 00:34:04,039
I even recognize that little kid now.

729
00:34:04,039 --> 00:34:05,720
The boss won't pay compensation.

730
00:34:05,720 --> 00:34:07,519
Don't give me that crap.

731
00:34:08,519 --> 00:34:10,320
Do you want the court to call the police?

732
00:34:11,639 --> 00:34:13,320
Do you want me to call the police?

733
00:34:15,880 --> 00:34:17,039
Tell them to disperse.

734
00:34:24,159 --> 00:34:25,159
Pay us back!

735
00:34:29,800 --> 00:34:30,440
Hey.

736
00:34:30,519 --> 00:34:31,559
That's enough.

737
00:34:31,960 --> 00:34:33,760
If you keep this up, they'll call the cops.

738
00:34:34,280 --> 00:34:35,719
You'll still get paid as extras today.

739
00:34:35,960 --> 00:34:36,760
Let's clear out.

740
00:34:39,840 --> 00:34:40,480
Wrap it up!

741
00:34:41,079 --> 00:34:42,000
Time to get paid!

742
00:34:45,320 --> 00:34:46,360
Bro, how about an extra hundred?

743
00:34:46,360 --> 00:34:47,559
I recorded everything today.

744
00:34:47,559 --> 00:34:48,800
No problem. Let's go.

745
00:34:48,800 --> 00:34:49,400
Let's go.

746
00:34:50,000 --> 00:34:50,760
Add an extra hundred.

747
00:34:51,559 --> 00:34:53,440
They're not even hiding it anymore.

748
00:34:54,000 --> 00:34:55,119
So brazen about it.

749
00:34:55,119 --> 00:34:56,119
What kind of people are these?

750
00:35:06,239 --> 00:35:08,480
For a criminal case to reach the trial stage,

751
00:35:08,480 --> 00:35:10,239
the police must first open an investigation,

752
00:35:10,239 --> 00:35:11,800
and the prosecutor's office must review it.

753
00:35:12,119 --> 00:35:13,960
If the chain of evidence is insufficient or incomplete,

754
00:35:14,000 --> 00:35:15,639
it can be returned twice for supplementary investigation.

755
00:35:16,119 --> 00:35:17,400
You, Ding Ning, absolutely cannot

756
00:35:17,400 --> 00:35:19,280
disregard the hard work of so many people.

757
00:35:19,280 --> 00:35:20,760
Relying on such flimsy clues

758
00:35:20,760 --> 00:35:22,119
to push for an acquittal...

759
00:35:22,119 --> 00:35:23,239
Isn't that too risky?

760
00:35:23,280 --> 00:35:24,280
I know you're very persistent,

761
00:35:24,280 --> 00:35:25,280
but this persistence of yours

762
00:35:25,280 --> 00:35:26,679
can't lead you down a rabbit hole

763
00:35:26,679 --> 00:35:27,639
that you can't get out of.

764
00:35:28,360 --> 00:35:29,400
What are you doing?

765
00:35:30,280 --> 00:35:32,000
Did you hear what I said?

766
00:35:33,239 --> 00:35:35,440
What's going on in that head of yours?

767
00:35:36,079 --> 00:35:37,239
If the prosecutors feel

768
00:35:37,239 --> 00:35:38,840
the court's verdict is unfair,

769
00:35:38,880 --> 00:35:40,280
they can also lodge a protest

770
00:35:40,440 --> 00:35:42,400
to have the court retry the case, you know?

771
00:35:51,800 --> 00:35:52,760
What's wrong with her?

772
00:35:52,760 --> 00:35:53,760
She can't even take a little scolding?

773
00:35:54,519 --> 00:35:56,880
Ding Ning has had a stomachache for days.

774
00:35:56,880 --> 00:35:58,960
Getting sick on me just because I said a few words.

775
00:36:00,119 --> 00:36:01,199
Don't come to work tomorrow.

776
00:36:01,199 --> 00:36:02,199
Go see a doctor.

777
00:36:10,119 --> 00:36:11,079
Judge Yu.

778
00:36:22,440 --> 00:36:24,639
Excuse me, where is Dr. Wang?

779
00:36:25,039 --> 00:36:25,800
Dr. Wang?

780
00:36:26,360 --> 00:36:27,320
He works on Fridays.

781
00:36:27,320 --> 00:36:28,559
Right, I have an appointment with him.

782
00:36:28,559 --> 00:36:29,719
Today is Friday.

783
00:36:29,719 --> 00:36:30,599
Today is Thursday.

784
00:36:30,800 --> 00:36:31,840
Thursday?

785
00:36:33,239 --> 00:36:34,239
I'm sorry.

786
00:36:48,519 --> 00:36:49,480
Your number hasn't been called yet.

787
00:36:49,480 --> 00:36:50,239
Please wait outside for a moment.

788
00:36:50,239 --> 00:36:51,280
Come in when we call you.

789
00:36:51,360 --> 00:36:52,960
No, I'm the...

790
00:36:53,559 --> 00:36:55,079
Oh, you're the old man's family.

791
00:36:55,719 --> 00:36:56,599
He forgot to take this.

792
00:36:56,599 --> 00:36:57,360
Here you go.

793
00:36:57,760 --> 00:36:58,320
It's normal.

794
00:36:58,320 --> 00:37:00,599
That's how it is with Alzheimer's.

795
00:37:00,679 --> 00:37:01,519
Always forgetting things.

796
00:37:01,519 --> 00:37:02,199
It's understandable.

797
00:37:03,480 --> 00:37:04,400
Number 23.

798
00:37:12,320 --> 00:37:13,280
Let's go, senior.

799
00:37:17,719 --> 00:37:18,400
What are you looking up?

800
00:37:19,360 --> 00:37:20,079
Nothing.

801
00:37:31,159 --> 00:37:31,880
Zhou Hao

802
00:37:32,400 --> 00:37:33,960
Are Alzheimer's patients

803
00:37:34,360 --> 00:37:36,519
considered to lack civil capacity?

804
00:37:36,519 --> 00:37:37,920
Alzheimer's?

805
00:37:38,000 --> 00:37:39,199
You mean senile dementia?

806
00:37:40,440 --> 00:37:42,079
Yes. Why?

807
00:37:42,880 --> 00:37:43,639
Nothing.

808
00:37:44,400 --> 00:37:47,320
Then can a person like that be a judge?

809
00:37:47,320 --> 00:37:48,599
Probably not.

810
00:37:49,079 --> 00:37:51,159
Who would trust a trial led by someone like that?

811
00:37:52,400 --> 00:37:53,519
So you're saying,

812
00:37:53,840 --> 00:37:55,599
the cases he previously judged

813
00:37:55,719 --> 00:37:57,760
would lose their legal validity?

814
00:37:57,920 --> 00:37:59,039
You could apply for a retrial.

815
00:38:00,559 --> 00:38:01,559
What's up with you?

816
00:38:03,199 --> 00:38:04,760
I have a grad school classmate.

817
00:38:05,119 --> 00:38:06,559
The presiding judge of his case

818
00:38:06,559 --> 00:38:08,079
might have Alzheimer's.

819
00:38:08,599 --> 00:38:09,679
But he has evidence

820
00:38:09,679 --> 00:38:11,119
of the judge's suspected condition.

821
00:38:11,280 --> 00:38:12,559
But the problem now is,

822
00:38:12,840 --> 00:38:14,480
from the client's perspective,

823
00:38:14,480 --> 00:38:16,639
do you think my classmate is obligated

824
00:38:16,639 --> 00:38:17,639
to report this to superiors?

825
00:38:19,000 --> 00:38:20,800
That'd be the responsible thing for the client,

826
00:38:20,800 --> 00:38:21,360
right?

827
00:38:21,599 --> 00:38:23,000
Logically speaking,

828
00:38:23,440 --> 00:38:24,280
he should.

829
00:38:25,480 --> 00:38:27,480
But is your classmate trying to burn his bridges?

830
00:38:29,039 --> 00:38:30,760
Does he still want to work in the legal field?

831
00:38:31,960 --> 00:38:33,280
Even if he wants to do it,

832
00:38:33,559 --> 00:38:34,800
the law firm he works for

833
00:38:34,800 --> 00:38:36,400
probably wouldn't let him.

834
00:38:36,639 --> 00:38:37,840
Losing a case or two

835
00:38:37,840 --> 00:38:38,679
is acceptable.

836
00:38:39,119 --> 00:38:40,760
But if he insists on going against that judge,

837
00:38:41,679 --> 00:38:43,119
who would dare to hire your classmate

838
00:38:43,119 --> 00:38:44,360
or his law firm for a lawsuit?

839
00:38:45,960 --> 00:38:46,760
So,

840
00:38:48,079 --> 00:38:48,880
just let it go.

841
00:38:49,960 --> 00:38:51,079
Tell your classmate

842
00:38:51,880 --> 00:38:53,000
that pretending not to know

843
00:38:53,719 --> 00:38:55,719
is the best approach.

844
00:38:55,920 --> 00:38:56,599
I'm leaving.

845
00:38:56,719 --> 00:38:57,440
Don't stay too late.

846
00:39:15,800 --> 00:39:17,119
People like you

847
00:39:18,880 --> 00:39:20,039
will end up exhausted.

848
00:39:20,599 --> 00:39:21,320
People like you,

849
00:39:21,320 --> 00:39:23,440
who think life has all the answers.

850
00:39:29,079 --> 00:39:29,960
To you,

851
00:39:29,960 --> 00:39:31,920
this is just a lawsuit.

852
00:39:32,039 --> 00:39:33,880
What price do you pay if you lose?

853
00:39:34,280 --> 00:39:34,960
But me?

854
00:39:35,880 --> 00:39:39,440
I'm gambling with my family's fate.

855
00:39:40,639 --> 00:39:41,599
I can't afford to lose.

856
00:39:49,519 --> 00:39:51,079
Alzheimer's.

857
00:39:51,079 --> 00:39:53,000
Who would trust a verdict from someone like that?

858
00:39:55,239 --> 00:39:57,719
Truth and lies, right and wrong, good and evil.

859
00:39:58,079 --> 00:39:59,239
These things,

860
00:40:00,480 --> 00:40:03,360
you'll understand when you're older.

861
00:40:03,840 --> 00:40:06,039
They aren't as important as you think.

862
00:40:08,280 --> 00:40:09,480
Or perhaps,

863
00:40:09,639 --> 00:40:11,039
you never really cared.

864
00:40:12,840 --> 00:40:14,559
How I view good and evil, truth and lies,

865
00:40:15,559 --> 00:40:16,880
is not for you to judge.
